  "agent_feedback": {
    "analysis": "1. The purpose of the EKES table is to store details of vendor confirmations for purchase orders.\n2. It is related to the EKPO table (purchase order items) via the EBELN and EBELP fields, and to the LFA1 table (vendors) via the LIFNR field.\n3. Common use cases include:\n * Displaying vendor confirmations in reports\n * Updating vendor confirmations\n * Creating deliveries from vendor confirmations",
